```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as ProductDetailsScreen
    participant CC as CartController
    participant OR as OrderRepository
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant D as Dio Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant OrdS as Order Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    U->>PD: Tap "Add to Cart"
    PD->>CC: addItem(productId, qty)
    CC->>OR: addToCart(userId, productId, qty)
    OR->>OS: addToCart(userId, productId, qty)
    OS->>D: POST /orders/cart/items
    Note over D: JWT interceptor adds token
    D->>G: HTTP Request
    G->>OrdS: Proxy to Order Service
    OrdS->>DB: INSERT cart_item
    DB-->>OrdS: cart_item record
    OrdS-->>G: {id, cart_id, product_id, quantity, unit_price}
    G-->>D: 201 Created
    D-->>OS: Response
    OS-->>OR: CartItemModel
    OR-->>CC: CartItemModel
    CC->>CC: Refresh cart state
    CC-->>PD: AsyncValue<Cart>
    PD->>U: Show SnackBar "Added to cart"
    
    Note over CC,OR: Analytics Event
    CC->>CC: logEvent('add_to_cart')
```
